      "prompt": "Author benchmark task E1 (\"TB2 software-engineering task, easy band\", scenario 5) from stub to ready, following the /new-bench-task skill (.claude/skills/new-bench-task/SKILL.md) and the task contract (tasks/README.md), with task E6 as the worked pattern. First establish Terminal-Bench 2.0: its repository, its task format, and how a task's tests run, all cited. Find an easy-band TB2 task whose setup and tests run natively on both Windows and macOS, with no container (ADR-0013 Amendment 1). Try candidates in order; for each rejected, record why. If none qualifies, stop and report the candidates and the reasons rather than inventing a task or stripping a task's tests.",
